sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ES as ExternalSecret sonarqube-db
    participant C as ESO controller
    participant K as Kubernetes API
    participant STS as Google STS
    participant SM as Secret Manager
    participant L as Audit logs

    Note over ES,C: every 15 min, or immediately with force-sync
    ES->>C: reconcile
    C->>K: TokenRequest for KSA eso-sonarqube<br/>(audience: Workload Identity pool)
    K-->>C: short-lived KSA token
    C->>STS: token exchange
    STS-->>C: federated token<br/>principal …/ns/sonarqube/sa/eso-sonarqube
    C->>SM: AccessSecretVersion qa-sonarqube-db/latest
    Note over SM: IAM: secretAccessor on THIS secret<br/>for THIS principal
    SM-->>C: value
    SM->>L: access record with the principal
    C->>K: creates or updates Secret sonarqube-db<br/>(ownerReference to the ExternalSecret)
    C-->>ES: status Ready · SecretSynced
